- Update to upstream release 2.5.1 (published 2026-10-22 12:21 UTC, tag
  978d18f, 13 minutes after upstream withdrew 2.5.0.1). Re-tar of Source0:
  sha256 0d0ae82febf6b3924b975f79f277887edc9364de67be89831514400cd94b6db6
  (9427045 B). Delta 2.5.0->2.5.1 = 40 files: Python-only code (GPU
  selector, removal of Proton-EM/UMU-Proton compat-tool support, Flatpak
  "already running" fix, Steam shortcut fix) + translations + metainfo
  release notes + meson version string. Dependency re-derivation: import
  set unchanged (no new third-party modules), meson.build build deps
  unchanged, README runtime set unchanged (pygobject/gtk4/libadwaita/
  libmanette) - spec Requires/BuildRequires unchanged. Artifacts: no file
  renames (data/ identical except metainfo content) - %files unchanged.

